<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav M1 money supply drops in Nov vs Oct.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav M1 money supply drops in Nov vs Oct.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Yugoslavia reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>YUGOSLAV MONEY SUPPLY (in billions of dinars)</p>
<p>				  NOV 96     OCT 96     NOV 95</p>
<p> M1				5.006	5.042	2.834</p>
<p> M2				6.881	6.798	3.728</p>
<p> M2			     30.195     30.161     26.097</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
</text>
